      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 BBOX\n### Draft + Continue\n\n1. Select your local models.\n2. Set START and END boxes.\n3. Edit the scene and A / B descriptions.\n4. PREVIEW, review, then GO.\n\n**512 x 768 / 124 frames / 24 fps**\n\nText-only example. No reference images needed.\n\nBBOX guides composition and motion; inspect the generated result."
